            "review_title": "Review at Pasta Fresca",
            "review_text": "Cocochiaky\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam11 contributions\n2\nTerrible slow service\nMay 2019 • Solo\nI walked in at 8:17pm and placed the order right away. It was simple, just a caprese salad, a green spaghetti with meat balls. I was there until 9:04pm and my food never came on the table, not even the simple caprese salad! When they first entered Vietnam, things were fine but since they expand and try to open more spots, their services are dropping down dramatically. \nDon’t come, don’t waste your time for slow food while you are super starving late at night. All you will get is their “sorry” and no improvement.\nRead more\nWritten May 22, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
