            "review_title": "Review at Pasta Fresca",
            "review_text": "Samantha P\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam31 contributions\n0\nOkay Italian\nMay 2019 • Friends\nThis restaurant is very tiny and does not have A/C, so if you're looking for an escape from the heat you will not get it here. (They did have some fans set-up, but not enough to combat this intense heat.) The food was okay and the service was about the same. I'm not sure if they have a restroom or not, but I was told it was broken. After paying for my meal and having to trek 45 minutes across town, I found this to be incredibly inconvenient and kind of annoying. If you were a larger party, you would definitely want to make a reservation. Honestly, I don't think I would return and will continue to try and find satisfying Italian in Ho Chi Minh. Also, a gratuity of 10% is automatically applied to all bills, which is fine. Just beware so you don't tip twice!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten May 21, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
