            "review_title": "Review at Pasta Fresca",
            "review_text": "SerCateric\nMexico City, Mexico13 contributions\n0\nFeels like being back at your Nonna's house\nMay 2019 • Couples\nBeautiful pasta, wonderful service and delicious food. This place really feels like you are back home surrounded by friends and family. \nThe staff are so friendly and kind it feels like they have known you for years.\nThe food is delicious in taste and rustic in presentation like any great Italian place should be. You'll also be able to pick from several different homemade (you heard it right!) pastas and customize it with one of their delicious pasta sauces (just pick the meatballs, you won't regret it). \nThe music and atmosphere make you feel like you are back home in the best possible way, and you won't be able to stop yourself from dancing a bit in your chair. It really feels like every person loves being there and it translates directly to everything in the restaurant.\nIf you are craving pasta while far away from home and don't want to swim all the way to District 2, I highly recommend this place.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 18, 2019",
